,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\n\nWhen using table valued functions with **render_derived** joins_implicitly doesn't work\n\n### To Reproduce\n\n```python\nselect(Hero.hero_id, func.jsonb_to_recordset(Hero.skills).table_valued(\r\n    column(\"level\", Integer), column(\"skillId\", Text), joins_implicitly=True\r\n).render_derived(name=\"sk\", with_types=True)).where(Hero.hero_id == 1)\n```\n\n\n### Error\n\n```\r\nSAWarning: SELECT statement has a cartesian product between FROM element(s) \"sk\" and FROM element \"heroes\".  Apply join condition(s) between each element to resolve.\r\n``` \n\n### Versions\n\n- OS: Windows 11\r\n- Python: 3.10.4\r\n- SQLAlchemy: 1.4.34\r\n- Database: Postgres\r\n- DBAPI (eg: psycopg, cx_oracle, mysqlclient): psycopg2\r\n\n\n### Additional context\n\nPossible solution\r\n\r\nadd `new_alias.joins_implicitly = self.joins_implicitly` into render_derived on line\r\nhttps://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/blob/990715adb4529432250c9864b586e59aa60ed372/lib/sqlalchemy/sql/selectable.py#L1602","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy